From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:03:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(cd26): roll and score seeds from the sampler, with
 contact sheet and pick (W6b)

/customdim roll samples each seed with the Sampler (a 128-column disc and
the spawn patch), reads structure starts from the generator's placement
state, scores RollFacts against the v2 roll field and renders the best ten
with a structure layer, scorecards, roll.json and index.html. /customdim
pick writes a seed (or a rank) into the definition. Both are refused for a
dimension with chunks. RollSelfTest gates agreement, structure starts, a
five-seed roll, pick and the refusals; -PselfTestOnly=rollperf times 100
overworld seeds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
